For single-column steps, the result must be a supported vector-like output.

For block steps:
\itemize{
\item the result must be a \code{data.frame}
\item the number of rows must match \code{nrow(data)}
\item returned column names must be non-empty and unique
\item returned names must not collide with \code{key}
