\item returned names must be a subset of \code{expected_names}
\item missing expected names are added as \code{NA}
\item final output order follows \code{expected_names}
}

Because definitions are evaluated sequentially, later steps may use:
\itemize{
\item raw input columns from \code{data}
\item columns produced by earlier single-column steps
\item columns produced by earlier block steps
